            "_id": "697a3555031d105e630f4b0c"
          },
          {
            "sender": "citizen",
            "text": "Presented the invoice and a report from the authorized service center stating the motherboard failed due to a manufacturing defect within 3 days of purchase.",
            "time": "9:42:20 PM",
            "_id": "697a3564031d105e630f4b15"
          },
          {
            "sender": "SYSTEM",
            "text": "Judge allowed LAWYER to speak",
            "time": "9:42:52 PM",
            "_id": "697a3584031d105e630f4b1f"
          },
          {
            "sender": "lawyer",
            "text": "Argued that the damage could have been caused by a power surge at the Citizen's home and requested time to conduct an internal technical audit.",
            "time": "9:42:58 PM",
            "_id": "697a358a031d105e630f4b2a"
          },
          {
            "sender": "SYSTEM",
            "text": "JUDGE joined the courtroom",
