        "courtRoomId": "COURT_1769666902101",
        "closedAt": "2026-01-28T16:13:36.301Z",
        "judgementText": "Granted 7 days for the audit. The burden of proof lies on the retailer to prove \"external damage"
      },
      {
        "hearingId": "HEARING_1769667205626",
        "hearingDate": "2026-01-29T06:13:00.000Z",
